@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Ticket Execution — Local Slice Loop and Independent Function Verification

state "Coordinator dispatches fresh Ticket implementer\nClean context + scoped contract; shared Plan branch" as dispatch
state "Same implementer selects next ready Slice\nDependencies / acceptance / validation command" as select
state "Minimal implementation\nTest-first when useful" as implement
state "Local focused checks\nCheapest relevant checks first" as focused
state "Diagnose failure" as diagnose
state "Implementation worker fixes in-scope defect" as fix
state "BLOCKED\nRecord cause + verified checkpoint" as blocked
state "Coordinator re-plans Slice / Ticket" as replan
state "Slice locally complete\nRecord evidence" as slice_done
state "Development Complete\nAll Ticket Slices implemented + locally checked" as developed
state "Coordinator dispatches separate fresh verifier\nRead-only; all functionality scenarios" as verify
state "Verifier reports acceptance + mandatory dimensions\nExecuted evidence or concrete N/A reasons" as evidence
state "Coordinator decides Test Quality Gate" as gate
state "Implementation repairs affected function\nRun local checks; retain failed evidence" as repair
state "Verification BLOCKED\nRecord verification resume point" as verify_blocked
state "Ticket acceptance verified" as ticket_done

[*] --> dispatch
dispatch --> select
select --> implement
implement --> focused
focused --> diagnose : failure
focused --> slice_done : local checks pass
diagnose --> fix : implementation / test / regression defect
fix --> focused
diagnose --> blocked : dependency / environment
blocked --> select : cause resolved
diagnose --> replan : requirement / design conflict
implement --> replan : wrong assumption
replan --> select : updated contract
slice_done --> select : more Slices; same implementer
slice_done --> developed : all Slices locally complete
developed --> verify
verify --> evidence
evidence --> repair : FAIL: return to implementation
repair --> verify : repair locally validated\ncoordinator dispatches new verifier
evidence --> verify_blocked : checks cannot run
verify_blocked --> verify : cause resolved
evidence --> gate : complete evidence
gate --> ticket_done : PASS
gate --> verify : evidence gap; no repair needed
ticket_done --> [*]

note right of developed
Local RED/GREEN runs within the same implementation worker.
Formal verification covers the whole function, not one agent per Slice.
Workers never spawn agents; coordinator retains design and gates.
Context isolation does not isolate files or shared test state.
end note

note right of gate
Every acceptance criterion needs executed evidence.
Mandatory dimensions pass or have concrete N/A reasons.
Retry or agent replacement cannot erase unexplained flakiness.
end note
@enduml
